VI.2.П14.solution:
\[
\begin{gathered}
\left\{\begin{array}{l}
3 z-2 i w=14+3 i, \\
2 i z-w=-9
\end{array}\right. \Leftrightarrow\left\{\begin{array}{l}
3 z-2 i w=14+3 i, \\
w=2 i z+9
\end{array}\right. \Leftrightarrow \\
\Leftrightarrow\left\{\begin{array}{l}
3 z-2 i(2 i z+9)=14+3 i, \\
w=2 i z+9
\end{array}\right. \Leftrightarrow \\
\Leftrightarrow\left\{\begin{array}{l}
z=2+3 i, \\
w=2 i z+9
\end{array}\right. \Leftrightarrow\left\{\begin{array}{l}
z=2+3 i, \\
w=2 i(2+3 i)+9
\end{array}\right. \Leftrightarrow\left\{\begin{array}{l}
z=2+3 i, \\
w=4 i+3 .
\end{array}\right.
\end{gathered}
\]
Ответ. \(z=2+3 i, w=3+4 i\).

